{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/987246-chronicles-of-darkness-ability-information-compendium","id":987246,"title":"Chronicles of Darkness Ability & Information Compendium","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-10-14T07:24:14-07:00","id":987246,"title":"Chronicles of Darkness Ability & Information Compendium","content":"Hey guys,<br /> <br /> For the past little while, I've been working on a giant compendium for usage in Crossover games.<br /> <br /> Currently the game I'm running has multiple splats involved and I figured instead of having to constantly flip through tons of different books, I decided it would be easier in one giant google doc. The document has various information on things like disciplines, spells, and the like along with various other information. The document at the moment can also only be edited by me. For ease of access, you should be able to use the google outline along with Ctrl + F to find information (Eventually I'd also like to translate it into a PDF.)<br /> <br /> There is also some homebrew elements that are included in it - some of it from community members, along with current sample developments from Onyx Path (Like Hurt Locker Equipment stats on their google doc) and others that I created myself. (These elements will be colored differently to be able to notice.)<br /> <br /> Anyways here it is - hopefully it helps other Storytellers organize their campaigns. Good Luck Gaming friends!<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:red\">*snip*</span><br /> <br /> I'll be continually updating it - but any advice would be appreciated <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />. Thanks for all who take a look at it!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":269,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","user":"Charlaquin","date":". 10-14-2016, 12:05 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11457-volke","name":"Volke","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11457_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"127"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-14T09:07:07-07:00","id":987287,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:red\">Sorry, but that is <i>way</i> too much directly from the books to share publicly like this.</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-14T09:14:06-07:00","id":987293,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/987246-chronicles-of-darkness-ability-information-compendium?p=987287#post987287\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"color:red\">Sorry, but that is <i>way</i> too much directly from the books to share publicly like this.</span></div> </div> </div> </div>Oh I'm sorry D:<br /> <br /> I looked at the forum rules and I didn't see any rule against it so I thought it would be okay. I'll change the link immediately. I thought it would be fair to share. Sorry!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11457-volke","name":"Volke","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11457_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"127"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-14T09:20:34-07:00","id":987297,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Volke</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/987246-chronicles-of-darkness-ability-information-compendium?p=987293#post987293\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh I'm sorry D:<br /> <br /> I looked at the forum rules and I didn't see any rule against it so I thought it would be okay. I'll change the link immediately. I thought it would be fair to share. Sorry!</div> </div> </div> </div>It's not really a forum rule, so much as a law, sharing copyrighted information is piracy. Onyx Path and is usually pretty lenient about it when its for the purposes of discussion, but huge swaths of text like that are beyond that leeway. Feel free to share the homebrew stuff, though <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-14T09:24:30-07:00","id":987299,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/987246-chronicles-of-darkness-ability-information-compendium?p=987297#post987297\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's not really a forum rule, so much as a law, sharing copyrighted information is piracy. Onyx Path and is usually pretty lenient about it when its for the purposes of discussion, but huge swaths of text like that are beyond that leeway. Feel free to share the homebrew stuff, though <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>I see :/, I figured I could help other players out as it being used for reference mid-session, to be able to maintain crossover campaigns since it was only mechanical material - not as like a way to share private information or an excuse to not buy the books. Regardless - Thanks for letting me know before it became more public. I most likely will share the homebrew stuff - My bad though, once again.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11457-volke","name":"Volke","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11457_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"127"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-14T09:27:42-07:00","id":987305,"title":"","content":"For finding references to gameline materials, some of us maintain an expanded wiki index of what is where. <br /> We're pretty careful not to make it independently playable of the books.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://wodcodex.com\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://galleryternak.xyz/mahjongkjp.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://wodcodex.com\" target=\"_blank\"> KANGJP | Jalur Resmi Modern dengan Pengalaman Lebih Nyaman </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://wodcodex.com\" target=\"_blank\"> http://wodcodex.com </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Melalui KANGJP, pengguna dapat menjelajahi halaman yang tertata dengan alur sederhana serta pengalaman digital yang terasa lebih nyaman. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11818-romzombie","name":"ROMzombie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11818_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"35"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-14T12:30:22-07:00","id":987376,"title":"","content":"To be specific, game mechanics can't be copyrighted, but the specific expression of those rules can be, as well as game terms that are unique to those mechanics. So if you wanted to describe the mechanics of the game in your own words, that's perfectly legal, but it might be a bit difficult since you may not be able to use certain words. Skills and Attributes are used by multiple game systems to describe pretty much the same thing, but referring to a vampire's powers as Disciplines might be an issue. And you absolutely can't just copy and paste text from the books.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12354-who-is-matt","name":"who.is.matt","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"29"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-14T13:02:44-07:00","id":987391,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>who.is.matt</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/987246-chronicles-of-darkness-ability-information-compendium?p=987376#post987376\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">To be specific, game mechanics can't be copyrighted, but the specific expression of those rules can be, as well as game terms that are unique to those mechanics. So if you wanted to describe the mechanics of the game in your own words, that's perfectly legal, but it might be a bit difficult since you may not be able to use certain words. Skills and Attributes are used by multiple game systems to describe pretty much the same thing, but referring to a vampire's powers as Disciplines might be an issue. And you absolutely can't just copy and paste text from the books.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, that is more accurate. Thank you for clarifying.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}